OL,5,G2200 1988: Most Shocking Moments
OL,6,     FJan Leeming narrates the headlines
OL,7,     Fof 1988, when N.W.A. created the
OL,8,     Fblueprint for gangsta rap, Edwina
OL,9,     FCurrie caused a storm in an
OL,10,     Fegg-cup, and the Channel Tunnel
OL,11,     Fgot underway.
OL,12,G0000 Taggart
OL,13,     FMike Jardine and the team
OL,14,     Finvestigate after a therapist
OL,15,     Freturns home after his late-night
OL,16,     Fradio phone-in show to find his
OL,17,     Fwife murdered. Reid announces her
OL,18,     Fengagement.
